# Heavy env, rebuilt by bin/setup-tts-env.sh
.venv-tts/
# Isolated eval-only env for the Chatterbox-Flash benchmark (2026-08-08).
# Never touches .venv-tts; safe to delete once the bake-off is decided.
.venv-flash/
# Isolated eval-only env for the CosyVoice2 FULL JARVIS capability test (2026-08-08).
# Never touches .venv-tts, .venv-flash, or .venv-qwen; safe to delete once decided.
# DECIDED 2026-08-08 (decision c8291ab5): CosyVoice2 rejected on identity by Joe's
# ear — Engine A (current Chatterbox) still sounds more like Doc. Safe to delete.
.venv-cosy/
# Isolated eval-only env for the Higgs Audio v2 FULL JARVIS capability test
# (2026-08-08), the next candidate after CosyVoice2 was rejected. Python 3.12 to
# match .venv-tts; Higgs pins transformers<4.47 against CosyVoice's 4.51.3, which
# is exactly why it gets its own env. Never touches .venv-tts.
.venv-higgs/
